OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FSpeedboat killer Jack Shepherd has
OL,7,Fpleaded guilty to violently assaulting
OL,8,Fhis girlfriend, including attacking
OL,9,Fher with a set of barbecue tongs.
OL,11,FThe 38 year old pleaded guilty over a
OL,12,Fprison video link on Tuesday to two
OL,13,Fcounts of assault occasioning actual
OL,14,Fbodily harm and damaging property.
OL,16,FThe assaults happened in February and
OL,17,FJune last year, and sparked Shepherd's
OL,18,Frecall to prison.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/9
