FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37802
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FHe was originally jailed for 10 years
OL,7,Ffor manslaughter in 2018 over the
OL,8,Fdeath of 24 year old Charlotte Brown
OL,9,Fwhen his speedboat crashed during a
OL,10,Ffirst date.
OL,12,FShepherd skipped his Old Bailey trial
OL,13,Fwhile on the run in Georgia, before he
OL,14,Fwas eventually extradited back to the
OL,15,FUK to serve his sentence.
OL,17,FHe was set free on licence in January
OL,18,F2024, but faced recall to prison in
OL,19,FSeptember last year after he was
OL,20,Faccused of violence towards a new
OL,21,Fpartner.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37803
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FAt Isleworth Crown Court on Tuesday,
OL,7,FShepherd pleaded guilty to three
OL,8,Foffences as prosecutors agreed to drop
OL,9,Ftwo other allegations, of controlling
OL,10,For coercive behaviour and intentional
OL,11,Fsuffocation.
OL,13,FShepherd entered his guilty pleas over
OL,14,Fa video link from HMP Swaleside in
OL,15,FKent.
OL,17,FHe has admitted pinning down the woman
OL,18,Fand punching her in February 2025,
OL,19,Fstriking her in the chest with
OL,20,Fbarbecue tongs in June 2025, and
OL,21,Fdamaging her keys in that same month.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37804
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FJudge Martin Edmunds KC, the Recorder
OL,7,Fof Kensington and Chelsea, remanded
OL,8,FShepherd into custody until a
OL,9,Fsentencing hearing on September 4.
OL,11,FThe judge ordered a probation report
OL,12,Fon Shepherd's progress when he was
OL,13,Ffree from prison in 2024 and the first
OL,14,Fhalf of 2025.
OL,16,FShepherd told the court himself that
OL,17,Fhis latest release date from prison,
OL,18,Fat the end of the manslaughter
OL,19,Fsentence, is in January 2029.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
