PN,37805
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FAccording to a prosecution summary of
OL,7,Fthe case, he started dating the woman
OL,8,F` who is in her 50s ` in August 2024,
OL,9,Fbut towards the end of the year she
OL,10,Faccused him of being abusive and
OL,11,Fthreatening.
OL,13,FIn February 2025, Shepherd admitted
OL,14,Fpinning down the woman and "punching
OL,15,Fher several times, causing bruising to
OL,16,Fher arm and top of leg" during an
OL,17,Fargument.
OL,26,@vD@\OUxD@WO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/9
