PN,37806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FIn the second incident, in June 2025,
OL,7,FShepherd got angry with his partner
OL,8,Ffor burning a pizza during a barbecue,
OL,9,Fand "proceeded to hit her with the
OL,10,Fbarbecue tongs on her left breast
OL,11,Fwhich caused a permanent scar".
OL,13,FShe also accused him of "belittling"
OL,14,Fher with jibes about her weight and
OL,15,Fage, and accused her of flirting with
OL,16,Fother men.
OL,26,@qD@EOUsD@^O]uD@YOUuD@dO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
