OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,379,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37807
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FAs part of the controlling or coercive
OL,7,Fbehaviour charge, which Shepherd
OL,8,Fdenied and was dropped by prosecutors,
OL,9,Fthe woman claimed he had menacingly
OL,10,Fmentioned a violent former cellmate
OL,11,Fand allegedly told her it would be her
OL,12,F"last day" if she said anything bad to
OL,13,Fhis probation officer.
OL,15,FIn his manslaughter trial, the court
OL,16,Fheard that Shepherd, a web developer,
OL,17,Fmet Ms Brown, from Clacton-on-Sea,
OL,18,FEssex, for a first date, and offered
OL,19,Fto take her on a ride along the River
OL,20,FThames on his speedboat.
OL,26,@tD@AOUtD@JO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/9
