PN,37809
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F378A1785503911
OL,3,CSpeedboat killer admits assaulting
OL,4,Cpartner with barbecue tongs
OL,6,FAfter being brought back to the UK to
OL,7,Fserve his sentence, he was also jailed
OL,8,Ffor four years at Exeter Crown Court
OL,9,Fin 2019 for a drink-fuelled attack on
OL,10,Fa barman on March 16 2018 at The White
OL,11,FHart Hotel in Newton Abbot, Devon.
OL,13,FNews of his latest crimes first
OL,14,Femerged last month in a Parole Board
OL,15,Freport about his recall to prison.
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/9
